    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">A music player that stays on your device</string>
    <string name="about_description">Resonance is a free, open-source player for the music already on your phone. No accounts, no ads, no internet.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">What it can do</string>
    <string name="about_features">• Songs, albums, artists, folders and search
• Playlists, queue with drag and drop, favorites, smart lists
• Equalizer with presets, bass boost and virtualizer
• Live spectrum ring or a spinning vinyl record around the cover
• Colors taken from the album cover
• Synchronised lyrics from .lrc files
• Sleep timer, playback speed, skip silence
• Listening statistics with daily chart and streaks
• Home screen widget
• Material You design, light, dark and AMOLED themes, English and Russian</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Resonance has no accounts, servers, analytics or ads, and no permission to use the internet, so nothing can be sent anywhere. It reads your music through the Android media library. Playlists, favorites and statistics are stored only on this device. The lyrics folder is opened only if you choose one.</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_title">What\'s new</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_120_title">Version 1.2.0</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_120">• Lyrics from .lrc files
• Vinyl record mode
• Drag and drop in the queue
• Smart lists: recently added, most played, never played
• Statistics: daily chart and streaks
• Equalizer, speed and sleep timer moved to the player
• Play when headphones connect
• Smoother transitions</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_110_title">Version 1.1.0</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_110">• Spectrum visualizer and cover gestures
• Favorites, folders, settings
• Sleep timer, playback speed, skip silence
• Home screen widget</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_100_title">Version 1.0.0</string>
    <string name="about_changelog_100">• First release: library, playlists, queue, equalizer, statistics, album colors</string>
